  "body_markdown": "Follow\n\n(323) 433-5990\n\nHome\n\nServices\n\nAll-On-Four\n\nDental Implants\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nAbout\n\nFAQ\n\nForms\n\nBlog\n\nContact\n\n\n# Forms\n\n\n- Based in Los Angeles -\n\n\n### New Patients\n\n\nNew Patient Registration Form\n\nPatient Screening Form\n\n\n### Existing Patients\n\n\nHealth History Update\n\n\n### General Information\n\n\nDental Material Fact Sheet\n\nTalon NG Appliance Care\n\nHIPAA Policy\n\n\n### General Dentistry\n\n\nCrown and Bridge Procedures Consent Form\n\nDenture Consent Form\n\nFillings Consent Form\n\nImplant Restoration Consent Form\n\nInvisalign Consent Form\n\nNitrous Consent Form\n\nSeat Crowns Consent Form\n\nVeneer Consent Form\n\nZoom Consent Form\n\n\n### Oral Surgery\n\n\nBone Graft Consent Form\n\nBotox Consent Form\n\nCoronectomy Consent Form\n\nExtraction & Bone Graft\n\nExtraction Consent Form\n\nImplant Consent Form\n\nSedation Consent Form\n\nPre & Post-Operative Instructions\n\n\n### Periodontics\n\n\nCrown Lengthening Consent Form\n\nGingevectomy Consent Form\n\nLaser Consent Form\n\nOsseous Surgery Consent Form\n\nScaling & Root Planing Consent Form\n\nSinus Lift Augmentation Consent Form\n\nSoft Tissue Augmentation Consent Form\n\n\n## Contact Us\n\n\nFull Name *\n\nPhone\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\nWE PROVIDE THIRD PARTY FINANCING\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-on-Four-Implants\n\n\n#### Useful Links\n\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\n6200 Wilshire Blvd., #1609\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90048\n\nCopyright © 2026. Wilshire Smile Studio. All Rights Reserved. The Dental Implant Center of Los Angeles offers sedation dentistry and dental implant surgery, also serving West Hollywood, Santa Monica, Beverly Hills, and more. | Sitemap | Privacy Policy\n\nSkip to content\n\nOpen toolbar\n\nAccessibility Tools\n\nIncrease Text\n\nDecrease Text\n\nGrayscale\n\nHigh Contrast\n\nNegative Contrast\n\nLight Background\n\nLinks Underline\n\nReadable Font\n\nReset",
